 # Changelog
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+### Changed
+
+- `Client.request` retries idempotent requests twice by default, with backoff.
+- `open_session` takes `token` by keyword only, and a new `verify` flag.
+
+### Removed
+
+- The `httpkit.legacy` module.
 
