-items = client.get("/items", timeout=60)
+items = client.get("/items", timeout=60)  # a long listing: raise the timeout for this call
 ```
 
-Every request times out after 10 seconds unless you pass `timeout`.
+Every request times out after 30 seconds unless you pass `timeout`. Idempotent requests
+(GET, HEAD, OPTIONS, PUT, DELETE) are retried twice on a transport error or a 5xx answer,
+waiting 0.5 s and then 1 s; pass `retries=0` to turn that off.
 
